    <string key="page.blurb">From Abdali to the Citadel and Jabal Amman, up and down the hills. Watch for cameras and speed bumps, and weave through traffic without a crash.</string>
    <string key="page.T_MAPNOTE">The road roughly follows real places in Amman. The horn makes the car ahead move over.</string>
    <string key="page.T_R1S">Pick a trip between Amman landmarks, from Abdali to the Citadel to Mecca Mall, and reach the end.</string>
